      ],
      "en": [
        "Implicit animations run on the GPU, while explicit animations run entirely on the CPU",
        "Implicit animations can only run once, while explicit animations repeat indefinitely",
        "The animation manages itself internally, just changing the target value; Explicit animation must be self-managing\nAnimationController handler",
