    "level": "Vận dụng",
    "question": {
      "vi": "Sinh viên đang chạy ứng dụng, mởterminal khác chạy flutter pub add my_plugin (một plugin giao tiếp qua Method Channel), rồi bấm hot restart. Khi gọi My Plugin.get Data(), ứng dụng báo lỗi bên dưới. Cách khắc phục đúng là gì? Missing Plugin Exception(No implementation found for method get Data on channel my_plugin)",
      "en": "The student is running the application, opens another terminal running flutter pub add my_plugin (a plugin that communicates via Method Channel), then press hot restart. When calling My Plugin.get Data(), the application reports the error below. What is the correct fix? Missing Plugin Exception(No implementation found for method get Data on channel my_plugin)"
    },
    "options": {
      "vi": [
