      "vi": "Đây là một custom LLM provider cho Llm Chat View của Flutter AI Toolkit. Khi gán provider.history = saved Messages;, khung chat không cập nhật. Dòng còn thiếu ởvị trí chú thích là gì?\nclass My Llm Provider extends Llm Provider with Change Notifier {\nfinal List<Chat Message> _history = [];\n@override\nIterable<Chat Message> get history => _history;\n@override\nSet history(Iterable<Chat Message> history) { _history ..clear() ..add All(history);\n// missing step(s) here\n}\n// generate Stream and send Message Stream omitted\n}",
      "en": "This is a custom LLM provider for Flutter AI Toolkit's Llm Chat View. When assigning provider.history = saved Messages;, the chat frame does not update. What is the missing line in the comment position?\nclass My Llm Provider extends Llm Provider with Change Notifier {\nfinal List<Chat Message> _history = [];\n@override\nIterable<Chat Message> get history => _history;\n@override\nSet history(Iterable<Chat Message> history) { _history ..clear() ..add All(history);\n// missing step(s) here\n}\n// generate Stream and send Message Stream omitted\n}"
    },
